1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Little Fox

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
The tale of Jemima puddle duck.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Episode 2.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,000
A new friend.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Jemima hiked up a big hill.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,000
From the top, she saw a forest.

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
It was very far away.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Oh lay my eggs there.

9
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:41,000
She said.

10
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Jemima ran and flapped her wings.

11
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Up, up, up she went.

12
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Jemima flew through the air.

13
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Soon, she was flying over the forest.

14
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,000
She saw a nice spot and landed.

15
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:11,000
Jemima took a few steps and stopped.

16
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:15,000
A stranger sat on a tree stump.

17
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:19,000
He wore fancy clothes.

18
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Jemima didn't know that he was a fox.

19
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,000
The fox looked up from his newspaper.

20
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:30,000
He smiled.

21
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Hello.

22
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Said the fox.

23
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Are you lost?

24
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:41,000
What a nice gentleman.

25
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Thought Jemima.

26
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:46,000
No, I'm not lost.

27
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,000
She said.

28
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:51,000
I need a place to lay my eggs.

29
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,000
The fox grinned.

30
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,000
I love eggs.

31
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:00,000
He said.

32
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,000
And I love little ducklings.

33
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Oh?

34
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,000
Said Jemima.

35
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,000
Come with me, dear.

36
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Said the fox.

37
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:14,000
His teeth sparkled in the sun.

38
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:18,000
You can lay your eggs in my shed.

39
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:21,000
It will be very safe there.

